{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "17", "m": "08", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "04", "M": "29", "S": "50"}}, "news": [{"title": "Maharashtra releases draft model bye-laws 2026 for housing societies", "para": "Maharashtra's cooperation department has unveiled the draft Model Bye-Laws 2026 for housing societies, focusing on key areas like redevelopment, parking solutions, and electric vehicle charging installations. This comprehensive draft aims to enhance structural safety and establish grievance redressal systems for the state\u2019s over 1.25 lakh societies. Citizens are encouraged to share their feedback until August 27, influencing the finalization of these essential governance regulations.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/maharashtra-releases-draft-model-bye-laws-2026-for-housing-societies/133286145?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-557020/133286145.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}, {"title": "Chandigarh: Parveen Kansal\u2019s bail rejected in  \u20b947.89 crore Royal City money laundering case", "para": "Parveen Kansal's request for bail was denied by the court amid serious allegations of money laundering. Documentary evidence substantiating claims of fund siphoning was submitted, leading the court to express concerns over potential evidence tampering and the risk of the accused fleeing. The Enforcement Directorate maintained that Kansal retained control over the firm despite her resignation, with assets valued at around Rs 10.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/regulatory/chandigarh-parveen-kansals-bail-rejected-in-47-89-crore-royal-city-money-laundering-case/133286057?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-78064/133286057.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "regulatory"}, {"title": "Over 50% o